abstract: "Thermodynamic and phase-equilibrium values read from published papers, each with its evidence class, state, source paper, DOI, page and verbatim quote. Version 1, machine-extracted: values were read by language-model readers constrained to quote their source and checked automatically, and the release was then audited on the printed pages by adversarial audits, an independent second review of fit-facing records and a preliminary human review of a frozen sample. Flags such as accepted and ESPEI-ready record screening results, not certification; known issues are listed in the release notes."
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.PENDING-orchid-data"
    description: "Umbrella record ORCHID data (all datasets of release v2026.10)"
keywords: [CALPHAD, thermodynamics, phase diagrams, convex hull, DFT, formation enthalpy, AI-ready data]
